\newlabel{tab:exp1}{{2}{5}{\textbf {Few-shot depth-role reading} (from \texttt {results/gnn\_experiment.json}, exp1). Test macro-F1 on held-out graphs; node features are degree/edge-weight statistics only --- no positional features}{table.caption.4}{}}
