\newlabel{tab:transfer}{{3}{5}{\textbf {Transfer of structural reading} (exp2). Trained on 6 MLP circuit graphs (7 inputs, seeds 0--5); tested on held-out same-size MLP graphs (2), larger unseen-size MLP graphs (4, 9 inputs), and transformer graphs (4, 7 inputs, control). Values are test macro-F1}{table.caption.5}{}}
