\newlabel{fig:fewshot}{{3}{6}{\textbf {Few-shot depth-role reading.} Graph networks (GCN, GAT) infer unit depth bins from circuit structure alone --- no positional features --- and beat the feature-only baseline at every shot count}{figure.caption.6}{}}
